url: "https://lorihogenkamp-ops.github.io/esf-rosetta-map/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An interactive evidence map for the Evolutionary Stress Framework (ESF): 57 annotated sources
  across six evidence domains, linked by typed relations (supports, refines, constrains, challenges,
  background, develops) to the 14 Public Claims of the ESF Field Guide v1.0. Version 2.0.0 is a
  correction and canon-alignment release: 14 of the 50 v1.0 citations are corrected against Crossref,
  the claims are re-based on the published canon, the March 2026 map claims are kept as topics with
  their history, and every source-claim link is re-typed and marked proposed pending the author's review.
keywords:
  - Evolutionary Stress Framework
  - allostasis
  - regulatory bandwidth
  - neurodiversity
  - complexity science
  - evidence map
  - stress physiology
  - interoception
  - network medicine
